    "name": "Seasonala Cemetery",
    "steam_appid": 3272690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seasonala Cemetery</i> is a meditative experience that invites players to explore the serene beauty of a living, breathing cemetery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your system\u2019s real date and time, the game changes dynamically \u2013 visit in the summer to see the cemetery bustling with life, or explore in the quiet, snowy winter. Observe and interact with NPCs and animals as they visit <i>Seasonala Cemetery</i>, all while listening to ambient sounds recorded from a real-life cemetery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seasonala Cemetery</i> is a peaceful yet poignant reflection on life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how the cemetery changes through the seasons, time of day, and weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the city\u2019s history through its gravestones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the animals that call the cemetery home and the people who visit the cemetery at different times of the day, month, and year.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to ambient sounds recorded from a real-life cemetery alongside a beautiful soundtrack composed by halina heron.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up flowers, rocks, pinecones, and more and place them on gravestones you visit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely free experience for Windows and Mac.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seasonala Cemetery</i> is a meditative experience that invites players to explore the serene beauty of a living, breathing cemetery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your system\u2019s real date and time, the game changes dynamically \u2013 visit in the summer to see the cemetery bustling with life, or explore in the quiet, snowy winter. Observe and interact with NPCs and animals as they visit <i>Seasonala Cemetery</i>, all while listening to ambient sounds recorded from a real-life cemetery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seasonala Cemetery</i> is a peaceful yet poignant reflection on life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how the cemetery changes through the seasons, time of day, and weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the city\u2019s history through its gravestones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the animals that call the cemetery home and the people who visit the cemetery at different times of the day, month, and year.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to ambient sounds recorded from a real-life cemetery alongside a beautiful soundtrack composed by halina heron.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up flowers, rocks, pinecones, and more and place them on gravestones you visit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely free experience for Windows and Mac.</p></li></ul>",
